6157","label":"正文","text":"曹操下令使平议死刑可宫割者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-dd7a9aa390270163826f"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-df598a910128c729ad90","label":"正文","text":"钟繇主张复肉刑以代死刑，议者以为非悦民之道遂寝","evidence":["zhonghua-q-061b920a4bf6462b49ad"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"魏国既建、议复肉刑、令曰安得通理君子达于古今者使平斯事、昔陈鸿胪以为死刑有可加于仁恩者正谓此也、御史中丞能申其父之论乎","evidence":["huanchen-q-0b4e69e23945a9df215d"]},{"person":"wudi-p0394","role":"迁为御史中丞、被问者","evidence":["huanchen-q-0b4e69e23945a9df215d"]},{"person":"wendi-p0053","role":"以为时未可行","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-5deb26b9859ff9489591"]},{"person":"wudi-p0181","role":"主张复肉刑者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-061b920a4bf6462b49ad"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["huanchen-q-0b4e69e23945a9df215d"]},"ordering_evidence":"huanchen-q-0b4e69e23945a9df215d","source_order":[22,79,0],"order":4508}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0053","name":"王修","evidence":["wendi-q-p008","dongyuan-q-p075","yuanzhang-q-85ce750ad1e9b39d0637","yuanzhang-q-8525ea891fa31a63baa2","yuanzhang-q-434066e645e8bbdcfaf4","yuanzhang-q-a4a2f10db5f8d53ad348","yuanzhang-q-023ae24c3ebf79736592","yuanzhang-q-35070f346b5f5e8c55c6","yuanzhang-q-f64372d8e3abceea6f97","yuanzhang-q-47593db119630a4e70e0","yuanzhang-q-ee1c1ae51cddecd023ad","yuanzhang-q-2a9ecdd0de38aa3765b1","yuanzhang-q-4be0c977072286ffa6c6","yuanzhang-q-5a2f3a8101756cf8d343","yuanzhang-q-b2634bbf6292b11e6a2a","yuanzhang-q-0e45a3cbdaf9ce0ec072","yuanzhang-q-92b17e6e14fd2b10574d","yuanzhang-q-d7fd3d355b967e850681","yuanzhang-q-671d473b40fa0c999f2c","yuanzhang-q-bdc02a59a2ff6f3dcb3a","yuanzhang-q-4eac80e8985e2ef69c6d","yuanzhang-q-27df3e53fc23e2e65b18","yuanzhang-q-5deb26b9859ff9489591","yuanzhang-q-0ce0818944e681cafc09","yuanzhang-q-c46613b6f9c6cffa1965","yuanzhang-q-4206a656023340f318da","yuanzhang-q-b0281c58622989aa109f","yuanzhang-q-e106cb2a6fcbaae198ef","yuanzhang-q-dedeca235a6656f4e7e5","yuanzhang-q-a3383909eafd8396ae7e","yuanzhang-q-43c885ed6a7f931b38b3","yuanzhang-q-b8163c3e602822aa8562","yuanzhang-q-bbc125c3909870c148bd","yuanzhang-q2-ad8547a2d7119560cb73","yuanzhang-q2-abe79c164eb11b54b26b","yuanzhang-q2-10aadd295f6d8d3ec451","cuimao-q-123de1b11858cc8cb735"],"facts":[{"id":"yuanzhang-f2-f153c6bb65eb1eb710c8","text":"王修复守胶东令；孔融每有难，王修虽休归在家，无不至，孔融常赖以免。","evidence":["yuanzhang-q2-ad8547a2d7119560cb73"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-f2-3eacc11d1f377edc5d9a","text":"袁绍辟王修、除即墨令；后复为袁谭别驾。","evidence":["yuanzhang-q2-abe79c164eb11b54b26b"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-f2-847924ca4cb088d789e7","text":"魏国既建，王修为大（司）农、郎中令，后徙奉常。","evidence":["yuanzhang-q2-10aadd295f6d8d3ec451"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wendi-m-p008-wendi-p0053","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["wendi-q-p008"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-p075-wendi-p0053","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-p075"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"cuimao-q-123de1b11858cc8cb735","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-71af50ed5989381e6496","layer":"pei","quote":"以彭璆为方正，邴原为有道，王修为孝廉","attribution":"裴注·《续汉书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":95,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0ed74dd0dffffddb82dc","start":578,"end":596,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-e-p075c-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-f39003f8dec6806c0da9","layer":"pei","quote":"然信用群小，好受近言；肆志奢淫，不知稼穑之艰难。华彦、孔顺，皆奸佞小人也，信以为腹心；王修等备官而已。然能接待宾客，慕名敬士。使妇弟领兵在内，至令草窃市井而外，虏掠田野。别使两将募兵下县，有赂者见免，无者见取；贫弱者多，乃至于窜伏丘野之中，放兵捕索，如猎鸟兽。邑有万户者，著籍不盈数百；收赋纳税，三分不入一。招命贤士，不就；不趋赴军期，安居族党，亦不能罪也。","attribution":"《九州春秋》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":293,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-06a13297a618ccaa32fd","start":179,"end":358,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p075","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-f39003f8dec6806c0da9","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝四﹞《九州春秋》载：“授谏辞曰：‘世称一兔走衢，万人逐之；一人获之，贪者悉止：分定故也。且年均以贤，德均则卜，古之制也。愿上惟先代成败之戒，下思逐兔分定之义。’绍曰：‘孤欲令四儿各据一州，以观其能。’授出曰：‘祸其始此乎？’谭始至青州，为都督，未为刺史；后太祖拜为刺史。其土自河而西，盖不过平原而已。遂北排田楷，东攻孔融，曜兵海隅。是时百姓无主，欣戴之矣。然信用群小，好受近言；肆志奢淫，不知稼穑之艰难。华彦、孔顺，皆奸佞小人也，信以为腹心；王修等备官而已。然能接待宾客，慕名敬士。使妇弟领兵在内，至令草窃市井而外，虏掠田野。别使两将募兵下县，有赂者见免，无者见取；贫弱者多，乃至于窜伏丘野之中，放兵捕索，如猎鸟兽。邑有万户者，著籍不盈数百；收赋纳税，三分不入一。招命贤士，不就；不趋赴军期，安居族党，亦不能罪也。”","attribution":"《九州春秋》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":293,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-06a13297a618ccaa32fd","start":0,"end":359,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-0b4e69e23945a9df215d","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-8075cedef02999066fb4","layer":"original","quote":"魏国既建，迁为御史中丞〖10〗。时太祖议复肉刑〖11〗，令曰：“安得通理君子达于古今者，使平斯事呼〖12〗？昔陈鸿胪以为死刑有可加于仁恩者〖13〗，正谓此也。御史中丞能申其父之论乎","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":90,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-p008","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-5476707ed7cc1389d719","layer":"pei","quote":"丁亥令曰：“故尚书仆射毛玠，奉常王修、凉茂，郎中令袁涣，少府谢奂、万潜，中尉徐奕、国渊等，皆忠直在朝，履蹈仁义；并早即世，而子孙陵迟，恻然愍之。其皆拜子男为郎中。”","attribution":"裴注·魏书续引","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2a980d42bd6d8f9a3005","start":0,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-023ae24c3ebf79736592","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-3f3939f4e8c769250b63","layer":"original","quote":"举孝廉，修让邴原；融不听。﹝一﹞时天下乱，遂不行","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":262,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":110,"end":134,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-0ce0818944e681cafc09","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-2ef15ca8b25208e784f3","layer":"original","quote":"修闻变，召车马未至，便将官属，步至宫门。太祖在铜爵台望见之，曰：“彼来者，必王叔治也！","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":291,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":182,"end":225,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-0e45a3cbdaf9ce0ec072","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-d3d33978547fafd309bf","layer":"original","quote":"修时运粮在乐安，闻谭急；将所领兵及诸从事数十人，往赴谭。至高密，闻谭死，下马号哭曰：“无君焉归","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":202,"end":249,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-27df3e53fc23e2e65b18","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-2ef15ca8b25208e784f3","layer":"original","quote":"迁魏郡太守，为治抑强扶弱，明赏罚；百姓称之","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":291,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":92,"end":113,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-2a9ecdd0de38aa3765b1","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-06216bc65aebeb5c3a3e","layer":"original","quote":"绍死，谭、尚有隙。尚攻谭，谭军败，修率吏民往救谭。谭喜曰：“成吾军者，王别驾也！","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":278,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":70,"end":110,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-35070f346b5f5e8c55c6","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-3f3939f4e8c769250b63","layer":"original","quote":"顷之，郡中有反者。修闻融有难，夜往奔融。贼初发，融谓左右曰：“能冒难来，唯王修耳！”言终，而修至。复署功曹","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":262,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":135,"end":188,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-4206a656023340f318da","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-fd88fa5587611eb04783","layer":"original","quote":"顷之，病，卒官","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":292,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":7,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-434066e645e8bbdcfaf4","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-3f3939f4e8c769250b63","layer":"original","quote":"初平中，北海孔融，召以为主簿，守高密令","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":262,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-43c885ed6a7f931b38b3","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-8b6106fb2eaafacad8eb","layer":"pei","quote":"〔河北始开冶，遂以〕修为司金中郎将","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":307,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-48acd35371f5090c4fd6","start":10,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-47593db119630a4e70e0","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-06216bc65aebeb5c3a3e","layer":"original","quote":"袁谭在青州，辟修为治中从事","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":278,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-4be0c977072286ffa6c6","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-06216bc65aebeb5c3a3e","layer":"original","quote":"修曰：“东莱太守管统虽在海表〖5〗，此人不反，必来！”后十余日，统果弃其妻子来赴谭，妻子为贼所杀；谭更以统为乐安太守","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":278,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":153,"end":211,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-4eac80e8985e2ef69c6d","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-2ef15ca8b25208e784f3","layer":"original","quote":"乃礼辟为司空掾，行司金中郎将","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":291,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":74,"end":88,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-5a2f3a8101756cf8d343","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-d3d33978547fafd309bf","layer":"original","quote":"谭复欲攻尚，修谏曰：“兄弟还相攻击〖6〗，是败亡之道也！”谭不悦，然知其志节","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-5deb26b9859ff9489591","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-2ef15ca8b25208e784f3","layer":"original","quote":"太祖议行肉刑〖6〗，修以为时未可行，太祖采其议","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":291,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":133,"end":156,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-671d473b40fa0c999f2c","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-b2afdcab1212f6d6ed5b","layer":"original","quote":"谭之破，诸城皆服；唯管统以乐安不从命，太祖命修取统首。修以统亡国之忠臣，因解其缚；使诣太祖，太祖悦而赦之","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":290,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":26,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-8525ea891fa31a63baa2","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-5a6c84f62960aff7bed3","layer":"original","quote":"年二十，游学南阳，止张奉舍。奉举家得疾病，无相视者〖4〗；修亲隐恤之〖5〗，病愈乃去","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":261,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":59,"end":101,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-85ce750ad1e9b39d0637","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-5a6c84f62960aff7bed3","layer":"original","quote":"年七岁，丧母，母以社日亡〖2〗。来岁邻里社〖3〗，修感念母，哀甚；邻里闻之，为之罢社","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":261,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":58,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-92b17e6e14fd2b10574d","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-d3d33978547fafd309bf","layer":"original","quote":"遂诣太祖，乞收葬谭尸。太祖欲观修意，默然不应。修复曰：“受袁氏厚恩。若得收敛谭尸，然后就戮〖9〗，无所恨","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":251,"end":303,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-a3383909eafd8396ae7e","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-2d5c8c954ff0db30a2fd","layer":"pei","quote":"太祖既诛袁谭，枭其首，令曰：‘敢哭之者，戮及妻子！’于是王叔治、田子泰相谓曰：‘生受辟命，亡而不哭，非义也。畏死亡义，何以立世？’遂造其首而哭之，哀动三军。军正白行其戮，太祖曰：‘义士也。’赦之","attribution":"裴注·傅子","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":306,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2a96f5f08fb86abd62d8","start":10,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-a4a2f10db5f8d53ad348","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-3f3939f4e8c769250b63","layer":"original","quote":"高密孙氏，素豪侠，人客数犯法。民有相劫者，贼入孙氏〖7〗；吏不能执，修将吏民围之。孙氏拒守，吏民畏惮，不敢近。修令吏民：“敢有不攻者，与同罪！”孙氏惧，乃出贼。由是豪强慑服","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":262,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":23,"end":109,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-b0281c58622989aa109f","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-fd88fa5587611eb04783","layer":"original","quote":"修识高柔于弱冠〖10〗，异王基于童幼；终皆远至〖11〗，世称其知人","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":292,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":25,"end":58,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-b2634bbf6292b11e6a2a","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-d3d33978547fafd309bf","layer":"original","quote":"后又问修：“计安出？”修曰：“夫兄弟者，左右手也。譬人将斗而断其右手，而曰‘我必胜’，若是者可乎？夫弃兄弟而不亲，天下其谁亲之！属有谗人〖7〗，固将交斗其间〖8〗，以求一朝之利。愿明使君塞耳勿听也。若斩佞臣数人，复相亲睦；以御四方，可以横行天下！”谭不听，遂与尚相攻击，请救于太祖","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":39,"end":179,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-b8163c3e602822aa8562","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-8b6106fb2eaafacad8eb","layer":"pei","quote":"陈黄白异议，因奏记曰：‘修闻枳棘之林，无梁柱之质；涓流之水，无洪波之势。是以在职七年，忠谠不昭于时，功业不见于事；欣于所受，俯惭不报；未尝不长夜起坐，中饭释餐。何者？力少任重，不堪而惧也。谨贡所议如左","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":307,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-48acd35371f5090c4fd6","start":28,"end":128,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-bbc125c3909870c148bd","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-8b6106fb2eaafacad8eb","layer":"pei","quote":"太祖甚然之，乃与修书曰：‘君澡身浴德，流声本州；忠能成绩，为世美谈；名实相副，过人甚远。孤以心知君，至深至熟，非徒耳目而已也。察观先贤之论，多以盐铁之利，足赡军国之用。昔孤初立司金之官，念非屈君，余无可者。故与君教曰：“昔遏父陶正，民赖其器用；及子妫满，建侯于陈。近桑弘羊，位至三公。此君元龟之兆先告者也。”是孤用君之本言也，或恐众人未晓此意。自是以来，在朝之士，每得一显选，常举君为首。及闻袁军师、众贤之议，以为不宜越君。然孤执心，将有所厎：以军师之职，闲于司金；至于建功，重于军师。孤之精诚，足以达君；君之察孤，足以不疑。但恐傍人浅见，以蠡测海，为蛇画足；将言前后百选，辄不用之，而使此君沉滞冶官；张甲李乙，尚犹先之，此主人意待之不优之效也。孤惧有此空声冒实，淫蛙乱耳。假有斯事，亦庶钟期不失听也；若其无也，过备何害？昔宣帝察少府萧望之，才任宰相；故复出之，令为冯翊。从正卿往，似于左迁。上使侍中宣意曰：“君守平原日浅，故复试君三辅，非有所间也。”孤揆先主中宗之意，诚备此事。既君崇勋业，以副孤意。公叔文子与臣俱升，独何人哉","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":307,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-48acd35371f5090c4fd6","start":130,"end":594,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-bdc02a59a2ff6f3dcb3a","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-2ef15ca8b25208e784f3","layer":"original","quote":"太祖破邺，籍没审配等家财物赀以万数〖3〗；及破南皮，阅修家：谷不满十斛，有书数百卷。太祖叹曰：“士不妄有名","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":291,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":69,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-c026606f39d90f6450d2","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-2ef15ca8b25208e784f3","layer":"original","quote":"其后严才反，与其徒属数十人攻掖门","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":291,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":162,"end":178,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-c46613b6f9c6cffa1965","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-2ef15ca8b25208e784f3","layer":"original","quote":"相国钟繇谓修：“旧〖8〗：京城有变，九卿各居其府〖9〗。”修曰：“食其禄，焉避其难？居府虽旧，非赴难之义","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":291,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":226,"end":278,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-d7fd3d355b967e850681","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-b2afdcab1212f6d6ed5b","layer":"original","quote":"太祖嘉其义，听之。﹝一﹞以修为督军粮〖1〗，还乐安","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":290,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-dedeca235a6656f4e7e5","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-c00a9136d8d5d7b298f8","layer":"pei","quote":"修重辞，融答曰：“掾，清身洁己，历试诸难；谋而鲜过，惠训不倦。余嘉乃勋，应乃懿德，用升尔于王庭，其可辞乎","attribution":"裴注·融集","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":277,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1d13a84929f425d05ea1","start":67,"end":119,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-e106cb2a6fcbaae198ef","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-c00a9136d8d5d7b298f8","layer":"pei","quote":"《融集》有融答修教曰：“原之贤也，吾已知之矣。昔高阳氏有才子八人，尧不能用；舜实举之。原可谓不患无位之士；以遗后贤，不亦可乎","attribution":"裴注·融集","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":277,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1d13a84929f425d05ea1","start":3,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-ee1c1ae51cddecd023ad","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-06216bc65aebeb5c3a3e","layer":"original","quote":"别驾刘献，数毁短修〖1〗，后献以事当死；修理之〖2〗，得免。时人益以此多焉","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":278,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-f64372d8e3abceea6f97","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-3c8c74d6940671cd1b33","layer":"original","quote":"胶东人公沙卢，宗强；自为营堑〖9〗，不肯应发调〖10〗。修独将数骑，径入其门，斩卢兄弟；公沙氏惊愕，莫敢动。修抚慰其余，由是寇少止","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":263,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":18,"end":83,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q2-10aadd295f6d8d3ec451","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-2ef15ca8b25208e784f3","layer":"original","quote":"袁氏政宽，在职势者多蓄聚〖2〗；太祖破邺，籍没审配等家财物赀以万数〖3〗；及破南皮，阅修家：谷不满十斛，有书数百卷。太祖叹曰：“士不妄有名〖4〗！”乃礼辟为司空掾，行司金中郎将〖5〗。迁魏郡太守，为治抑强扶弱，明赏罚；百姓称之。﹝二﹞魏国既建，为大（司）农、郎中令。太祖议行肉刑〖6〗，修以为时未可行，太祖采其议。徙为奉常。其后严才反，与其徒属数十人攻掖门〖7〗。修闻变，召车马未至，便将官属，步至宫门。太祖在铜爵台望见之，曰：“彼来者，必王叔治也！”相国钟繇谓修：“旧〖8〗：京城有变，九卿各居其府〖9〗。”修曰：“食其禄，焉避其难？居府虽旧，非赴难之义！”","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":291,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":280,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q2-513a3c93741a277e40d9","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-2d5c8c954ff0db30a2fd","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《傅子》曰：“太祖既诛袁谭，枭其首，令曰：‘敢哭之者，戮及妻子！’于是王叔治、田子泰相谓曰：‘生受辟命，亡而不哭，非义也。畏死亡义，何以立世？’遂造其首而哭之，哀动三军。军正白行其戮，太祖曰：‘义士也。’赦之。”臣松之按《田畴传》，畴为袁尚所辟，不被谭命。《傅子》合而言之，有违事实。","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文）","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":306,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2a96f5f08fb86abd62d8","start":0,"end":145,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q2-abe79c164eb11b54b26b","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-06216bc65aebeb5c3a3e","layer":"original","quote":"袁谭在青州，辟修为治中从事。别驾刘献，数毁短修〖1〗，后献以事当死；修理之〖2〗，得免。时人益以此多焉。袁绍又辟修，除即墨令。后复为谭别驾。绍死，谭、尚有隙。尚攻谭，谭军败，修率吏民往救谭。谭喜曰：“成吾军者，王别驾也！”谭之败，刘询起兵漯阴〖3〗，诸城皆应。谭叹息曰：“今举州背叛，岂孤之不德邪〖4〗？”修曰：“东莱太守管统虽在海表〖5〗，此人不反，必来！”后十余日，统果弃其妻子来赴谭，妻子为贼所杀；谭更以统为乐安太守。","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":278,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":212,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q2-ad8547a2d7119560cb73","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-3c8c74d6940671cd1b33","layer":"original","quote":"时胶东多贼寇〖8〗，复令修守胶东令。胶东人公沙卢，宗强；自为营堑〖9〗，不肯应发调〖10〗。修独将数骑，径入其门，斩卢兄弟；公沙氏惊愕，莫敢动。修抚慰其余，由是寇少止。融每有难，修虽休归在家〖11〗，无不至。融常赖修以免。","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":263,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-061b920a4bf6462b49ad","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-5bcca2cbccafa0b40c17","layer":"original","quote":"繇以为：“古之肉刑，更历圣人〖2〗；宜复施行，以代死刑。”议者以为非悦民之道〖3〗，遂寝","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":20,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-dd7a9aa390270163826f","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-5bcca2cbccafa0b40c17","layer":"original","quote":"初，太祖下令，使平议死刑可宫割者","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
